name: sim.getScriptFunctions
description: Retrieves a map of another script functions, that can be called
pythonSynopsis: map object = sim.getScriptFunctions(int scriptHandle)
inputs:
1. scriptHandle: the handle of the script. See sim.getScript
outputs:
1. object: a meta object. Functions can be called with object:functionName()
replacedBy:
- name: getFunctions, class: detachedScript, file: detachedScript_getFunctions.method
